@startuml FR02_Identity_UseCase
title FR-02 - Authentication and Role Access
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
actor "Staff Member" as Staff
actor "Administrator" as Admin
actor "Bank Administrator" as BankAdmin
actor "Bank Staff" as BankStaff
actor "Laboratory Staff" as LabStaff
actor "Hospital Staff" as HospitalStaff
Admin --|> Staff
BankAdmin --|> Staff
BankStaff --|> Staff
LabStaff --|> Staff
HospitalStaff --|> Staff
rectangle "Blood Bank Platform - Identity" {
  usecase "UC-02.1\nLog In" as Login
  usecase "UC-02.2\nLog Out" as Logout
  usecase "UC-02.3\nAccess Permitted Operation" as Access
  usecase "UC-02.4\nAssign a Permitted Bank Staff Role\nWithin the Same Bank" as Assign
}
Staff --> Login
Staff --> Logout
Staff --> Access
BankAdmin --> Assign
note right of Assign
  Backend policy verifies:
  - Equal, non-null bank_id values for actor and target.
  - Requested role is one of:
    bank_donor_collection
    bank_inventory
    bank_fulfillment
  Deny cross-bank changes and all other target roles.
end note
note bottom of Access
  Backend checks authentication, account activity,
  role permission and organization scope.
  Staff cannot change another organization's records.
end note
@enduml